LRC(14) PRIME-MASK / COIMAGE TRANSFER SCOUT S19
========================================================================================
Goal: test whether the hidden recurrence is a finite prime-mask transfer coupled to the signed mod-7 coimage tail.

========================================================================================
UNIT SEAM LAW: (Z/14Z)^* REDUCES TO F_7^*
========================================================================================
units mod 14: (1, 3, 5, 9, 11, 13)
reductions mod 7: (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6)
F_7^*: (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6)
Readout: the HYP-2617 projectivization by F_7^* is exactly the unit action inherited from the 14-runner clock.  The coimage class is therefore a coimage of the LRC14 unit seam, not an arbitrary mod-7 trick.

